The Mercedes-Benz Vito Dualiner is a crew van variant of the W447 generation Vito, which has been in production since 2014 and received updates in 2019/2020 and 2024. It is designed to carry both passengers and cargo, typically featuring a second row of seats behind the front seats.

The most recent Vito Dualiner (Crew Van) is available in two lengths (L2 and L3) and typically comes with a 2.0-litre diesel engine in various power outputs (like the 114, 116, or 119 CDI), paired with rear-wheel drive and often an automatic transmission. It offers seating for up to 6 people and a significant amount of cargo space behind the second row.

